{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>He restored me to my post.</b> Pharaoh — the one mentioned above, as it says ״Pharaoh was wrathful with his servants.״ See, Scripture is elliptical in expression and did not specify who restored — because there is no need to specify. Who restored? The one in whose hand it is to restore, and that is Pharaoh. And so is the way of all elliptical verses: regarding the one upon whom it is to do the thing, they leave the matter unspecified."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:02:53.645180358Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}